{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE!! All new arcade-style multiplayer gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Together. Inspect Smart. Ship Fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a cooperative multiplayer game where players join together as hippos operating a growing space depot. Orders appear on-screen requesting specific materials. Your Job is Simple:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Find the Right Material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ship It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with up to 8 of your friends. Individual score is calculate and displayed but the true value comes in cooperation. Achievements are team based.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders Appear - No doubt from deserving hipponauts such as yourself. Thankfully our systems have a general idea of supply, so you'll only get orders that you are able to complete....if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Clock - Move quickly to inspect boxes to reveal time anomalies that add time to the clock. The longer you have the more you can ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search The Depot - As your moving through the depot don't forget to inspect boxes because that has been shown to reveal anomalies that can add time, more drones, or additional rooms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scanning - You'll have access to a scanner which has a cooldown. Use it wisely but never just it. You'll never compete with our Elite Stampeders like that.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Warm-Up Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857170/c69d3604ca01c3627372639fa02bf4dc18c968d8.jpg"},{"name":"Solid Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857170/215b5c603dd2817dd31d768e45686196bd3e9e38.jpg"},{"name":"Hundred Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857170/4dac682cd48ea1a2ab4f302ec461af31326bdd57.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857170/cd29efa38a6aab16650a7eb552271709b4f6a925.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Stampede","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857170/3ee0d4445be9ef4d55829cdaf6e6579cc5209486.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857170?t=1768265480","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857170/83135e27bb312b018c53977d407aca0624b13c59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768265480","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857170/5e4df1decb10749f0bfcba6cfe491329ca43416c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768265480","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857170/5e4df1decb10749f0bfcba6cfe491329ca43416c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768265480","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAJOR UPDATE!! All new arcade-style multiplayer gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Space Depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Together. Inspect Smart. Ship Fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a cooperative multiplayer game where players join together as hippos operating a growing space depot. Orders appear on-screen requesting specific materials. Your Job is Simple:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Find the Right Material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ship It.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with up to 8 of your friends. Individual score is calculate and displayed but the true value comes in cooperation. Achievements are team based.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders Appear - No doubt from deserving hipponauts such as yourself. Thankfully our systems have a general idea of supply, so you'll only get orders that you are able to complete....if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the Clock - Move quickly to inspect boxes to reveal time anomalies that add time to the clock. The longer you have the more you can ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search The Depot - As your moving through the depot don't forget to inspect boxes because that has been shown to reveal anomalies that can add time, more drones, or additional rooms.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scanning - You'll have access to a scanner which has a cooldown. Use it wisely but never just it. You'll never compete with our Elite Stampeders like that.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Zenventorymgmt"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857170/d8140f61f66d56da0562df7ee61aa22e63175e83/header.jpg?t=1768265480","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"mo